.TH okf-jawn-move_item 1  "move_item " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-move_item \- Move an item and rewrite references in one committed change.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn move_item\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move an item and rewrite references in one committed change.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fI<JSON>\fR [default: {}]
The operation\*(Aqs JSON input: inline, @file, or \- for standard input
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<URL>\fR [default: http://127.0.0.1:7711]
The service address: HTTPS, or HTTP for a loopback address
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
